  "stem": "The area of a trapezoid with parallel sides \\(a\\) and \\(b\\) and height \\(h\\) is \\(\\frac{1}{2}(a + b)h\\). A trapezoid has parallel sides of length \\(7\\) and \\(13\\) and an area of \\(90\\). What is the height of the trapezoid?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "9"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Substitute: \\(\\frac{1}{2}(7 + 13)h = 90\\), so \\(10h = 90\\).",
    "\\(h = 9\\)."
  ],
